<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Blackout 黑屏思考</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:,">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/map.css">
<script src="/static/js/i18n.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/cues.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/speech.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/capture.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/map.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/result.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/black.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/start.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<main id="page-start" class="page start-page">
<button id="langToggle" type="button" class="lang-toggle">English</button>
<div class="start-columns">
<section class="start-left">
<p class="brand">Blackout</p>
<h1 class="start-headline"><span class="headline-line" data-i18n="headline1">不看屏幕，</span><span class="headline-line" data-i18n="headline2">说着把事想清楚。</span></h1>
<p class="start-subline" data-i18n="subline">你只管说。说完，给你一页总结和一张图。</p>
<div class="goal-line">
<input id="goalInput" type="text" data-i18n-placeholder="goalPlaceholder" placeholder="这次想想清楚什么？比如：下周的汇报怎么讲" maxlength="2000" autocomplete="off">
<button id="micBtn" type="button" class="mic-btn" aria-label="语音输入目标"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V6a3 3 0 1 0-6 0v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0h-2a5 5 0 0 1-10 0H5z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M11 18h2v3h-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button>
</div>
<button id="startBtn" type="button" class="primary lights-off" data-i18n="startButton">关灯，开始说</button>
<p class="quiet-line" data-i18n="smallLine">屏幕会变黑，直接开口。说「结束」，灯亮，出图。</p>
<button id="continueLastBtn" type="button" class="quiet-btn" data-i18n="continueLast" hidden>继续上次</button>
<p id="voiceWarning" class="warning" data-i18n="noVoice" hidden>这台设备没有中文语音，AI 的声音可能听不到。建议用 Chrome 或 Edge，或安装中文语音。</p>
<p id="startErr" class="error" role="alert"></p>
</section>
<aside class="start-right">
<figure class="how-sheet">
<img id="howItWorksImg" src="/static/how_it_works_zh.jpg" data-i18n-alt="howAlt" alt="三格手绘图：一个人开口说话，屏幕变黑安静思考，最后出现一页总结和一张图。">
</figure>
</aside>
</div>
<div class="start-below">
<label class="check">
<input id="openObserver" type="checkbox">
<span data-i18n="observerCheck">录视频：同时打开星图窗口</span>
</label>
<button id="pastToggle" type="button" class="past-toggle" hidden></button>
<section id="recentSection" class="recent" hidden>
<div id="recentList"></div>
</section>
</div>
</main>
<div id="page-black" hidden>
<div id="dot" class="dot reconnecting"></div>
<div id="hint" class="hint" data-i18n="blackHint">空格暂停 · 说“结束”或按 Esc 结束</div>
</div>
<main id="page-result" class="page result-page" hidden>
<h2 id="resultTitle">成果</h2>
<p id="resultGoal" class="result-goal"></p>
<div id="degradedNotice" class="warning" data-i18n="degraded" hidden>AI 整理没有完成，下面是对话中记录的原始内容。</div>
<div class="summary-block">
<p id="resultSummary" class="summary-text" hidden></p>
<button id="stopReadingBtn" type="button" class="quiet-btn" data-i18n="stopReading" hidden>停止朗读</button>
</div>
<figure id="posterFigure" class="poster-figure" hidden></figure>
<div id="result"></div>
<p id="resultErr" class="error" role="alert"></p>
<div class="result-actions">
<button id="copyBtn" type="button" class="primary ink-btn" data-i18n="copyMarkdown">复制为 Markdown</button>
<label id="sketchLabel" class="buttonlike quiet-btn" for="sketchInput" data-i18n="addSketch">加入纸上草稿</label>
<input id="sketchInput" type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment" hidden>
<button id="restartBtn" type="button" class="quiet-btn" data-i18n="startAgain">再来一次</button>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
